1
00:00:00,901 --> 00:00:04,561
(Leonard:)You need to watch Buffy the Vampire Slayer.
The perfect show for the two of us.

2
00:00:04,772 --> 00:00:08,872
(Leonard:)It's got action and jokes and hot vampires
and romance. I cannot oversell this.

3
00:00:09,076 --> 00:00:10,406
(Leonard:)What do you say?

4
00:00:11,112 --> 00:00:13,082
It's 6:30 in the morning.

5
00:00:15,583 --> 00:00:17,743
(Leonard:)I thought you grew up on a farm.

6
00:00:20,755 --> 00:00:25,655
(Sheldon(on phone):)Hello, Syfy Network,
this is your vice president of programing.

7
00:00:26,460 --> 00:00:29,830
(Sheldon(on phone):)We have made a horrible mistake
regarding Alphas.

8
00:00:30,064 --> 00:00:32,894
(Sheldon(on phone):)We need to uncancel it immediately.

9
00:00:33,067 --> 00:00:35,127
(Sheldon(on phone):)Put me through
to the people who handle that.

10
00:00:35,336 --> 00:00:38,276
(Sheldon(on phone):)Tell them it's me.
I don't wanna answer a lot of questions...

11
00:00:38,472 --> 00:00:40,302
(Sheldon(on phone):)...about if I really am who I say I am.

12
00:00:41,042 --> 00:00:43,072
(Sheldon(on phone):)I just... I want this done.

13
00:00:43,911 --> 00:00:46,171
No, I'm not the person who just called.

14
00:00:48,049 --> 00:00:50,539
(Sheldon(on phone):)That man was clearly a cowboy...

15
00:00:51,485 --> 00:00:53,975
(Sheldon(on phone):)...concerned about y'all
canceling his favorite show.

16
00:00:56,490 --> 00:00:58,790
(Sheldon(on phone):)Why do they keep hanging up on me?

17
00:00:58,993 --> 00:01:00,423
(Amy:)I'm sorry you're upset.

